frontend/playwright-report/
frontend/blob-report/
frontend/playwright/.cache/
# ...and the stray run dir Playwright leaves when invoked from the repo root
# rather than from frontend/.
test-results/

backup_files/
.mimocode/
mongo-backup/

# Vendored Lovable landing-page project — the source of the marketing page that
# frontend/scripts/build-landing.mjs compiles into frontend/public/landing/. It's
# a separate stack (TanStack Start + Vite + Tailwind v4) with its own dependency
# tree, so `npm install` in frontend/ does not reach it.
#
# Tracked, because it is now the only source for a page we ship. What follows are
# the parts of it that must NOT be:
#
#   · .workspace/ holds a Lovable access token in .git/config's remote URL. This
#     rule is the one thing standing between that credential and the history —
#     do not relax it. (The token predates this repo and is worth rotating.)
#   · .git is a dangling gitfile pointing into a Nix store path from the
#     container Lovable generated it in. Left in place, git reads the folder as a
#     gitlink and silently stages nothing but an unresolvable commit pointer.
frontend/LandingPage/.workspace/
frontend/LandingPage/.lovable/
frontend/LandingPage/.git
frontend/LandingPage/.tanstack/
frontend/LandingPage/.output/
frontend/LandingPage/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
# `dist/` and `node_modules/` above already cover this project's build output.

